  "prefLabel": "Lot 7002.06 Card-minding device system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.06 “Card-minding device system” means an electronic or computerized device and related hardware and software, used to automatically track announced bingo numbers, allowing the simultaneous play of a large number of bingo cards.\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34",
